[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":43},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-7,"_20":21,"_22":-7,"_23":24,"_25":26},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":41,"_13":41,"_28":42},"id","primeira-face","nome","1st face","rascunho",false,"html","<p>The 2x2 has only corners: 8 pieces, each with 3 colors. It has no centers, so no color has a fixed place: you choose. Here, as on the 3x3, white goes on the bottom and yellow on top. The first step is the white face, with a single algorithm: the <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a>, <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;face&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/2beffbb1a24cced6.svg\" alt=\"The goal, with the cube tilted to show the bottom face: the 4 white stickers together.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal, with the cube tilted to show the bottom face: the 4 white stickers together.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R2 F2 R2&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/415ca61c73ed0fae.svg\" alt=\"The sides may end up swapped: for Ortega, the face is enough.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The sides may end up swapped: for Ortega, the face is enough.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Start with one corner</h2>\n<p>Take any corner with white and hold the cube with it on the bottom, white facing down. From now on, white always stays on the bottom. The other 3 white corners go in next to this one.</p>\n<h2>Take a corner above the empty spot</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Turn the whole cube, keeping white on the bottom, until an empty bottom spot is at the <strong>front right</strong>.</li>\n<li>Look on top for a corner with white.</li>\n<li>Turn the top (<code>U</code>) until that corner is exactly above the empty spot.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Do the sexy move until the white faces down</h2>\n<p>Repeat <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code> until the corner goes down with white facing down. How many times depends on where the white is facing:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;face&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/a514a007b1dc0c8e.svg\" alt=\"White facing right: 1 sexy move.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing right: 1 sexy move.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R' U R U2 R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;face&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/cdbcb0107e82eec8.svg\" alt=\"White facing up: 3 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing up: 3 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F' U F&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;face&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/62d2d298c42a1cd0.svg\" alt=\"White facing the front: 5 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing the front: 5 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"R U R' U'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4b2c9a41d35916b5-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4b2c9a41d35916b5-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4b2c9a41d35916b5-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4b2c9a41d35916b5-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4b2c9a41d35916b5-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>White facing right, one sexy move and done: the corner goes down with green and orange on the sides.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>You don&#39;t need to count: do the sexy move and look. When the white faces down, stop. The other bottom corners stay in place, because the sexy move only moves the front right corner.</p>\n<h2>Corner on the bottom, with white on the side</h2>\n<p>If a corner with white is on the bottom, but with white facing the side, take it out: hold the cube with it at the front right and do one sexy move. It comes up, and you continue as above.</p>\n<h2>Face or layer?</h2>\n<p>For <strong><a href=\"/en/glossary#ortega\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"A 2x2 method: it builds one face, orients the top one (Ortega OLL) and permutes both layers at once (PBL).\">Ortega</a></strong>, the face is enough: the bottom sides may be swapped, and the last step (<a href=\"/en/glossary#pbl\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"On the 2x2 (Ortega): puts the pieces of both layers in place at once.\">PBL</a>) fixes them. For the <strong><a href=\"/en/glossary#basico\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Most people's first method: it solves the cube layer by layer, in 8 steps, with few algorithms. It's slow, but it teaches how the pieces…\">beginner method</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"/en/glossary#cll-eg\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"Fast 2x2 methods. In CLL, with the first layer done, the top one takes a single algorithm. In EG only the first face is needed (the bottom…\">CLL</a></strong>, the whole layer: the face and the bottom sides matching, with the two colors on each side the same.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;2x2&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;fl&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/f973b1139813b1d7.svg\" alt=\"The whole layer: the white face and the bottom sides matching.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The whole layer: the white face and the bottom sides matching.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>To build the layer, check the colors before the sexy move: the incoming corner goes next to the ones already on the bottom, and the colors of the sides that touch have to match. If they don&#39;t, turn the top and look for another corner.</p>\n","treino","metodos",[30,31,32],"anterior","proximo",{"_13":27,"_28":29},"grupos",[],"Yellow face","endereco","/2x2/basico/face-amarela",{"_13":39,"_34":35,"_28":40},{"_13":37,"_34":35,"_28":38},{"_13":33,"_34":35,"_28":36},"CLL / EG","numero",1,"/2x2/eg#primeira-face","Ortega","/2x2/ortega#primeira-face","Beginner method","/2x2/basico#primeira-camada","2x2","/2x2/",{"_44":45,"_46":47},"cubos",[50,51,52,53,54,55],"idiomas",[48,49],"pt","en",{"_11":62,"_13":62},{"_11":41,"_13":41},{"_11":61,"_13":61},{"_11":60,"_13":60},{"_11":58,"_13":59},{"_11":56,"_13":57},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","3x3"]
